+// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+// What a shell command writes in the project checkout, read from its text (no execution): redirects, tee, sed -i, mv and cp into the project, rm, touch, mkdir, git commands that change
+// the tree or history, and inline scripts that write files. Used by the hand-build guard (to block) and by the Orchestrator lane (so the hand-built share counts shell writes too).
